ABOUT US

Capco is a global technology and management consultancy specializing in driving digital transformation in the financial services and insurance industries. Capco is committed to providing clients with practical solutions. We offer a globally integrated service with offices in leading financial centers across the globe. We have the people, the vision, and the passion.

We are growing through a significant growth journey, now is a very good time to join us as we expand geographically, increase headcount and disrupt the consulting market across APAC with entrepreneurial and agile thinking

&nbsp;

ROLE RESPONSIBILITIES

We are currently seeking a Senior Consultant to support and drive the growth of our Securities Services practice, with a strong focus on Transfer Agency Transformation. This is an exciting opportunity to be a leader, driving complex client programs, shape delivery approaches, and building consulting capability across the practice&nbsp;

As a Senior Consultant within the Securities Services team, you be part of TA transformation projects across securities services for top-tier financial institution&nbsp;

&nbsp;

KEY RESPONSIBILITIES

• Work closely with business stakeholders, operations teams, product owners, and technology teams to deliver Transfer Agency transformation programmes

• Gather, analyse, and document business requirements, user stories, process flows, and functional specifications across the transfer agency operating model.

• Support change initiatives covering the end-to-end investor lifecycle

• Conduct business process analysis and identify opportunities for operational efficiency, controls enhancement, automation, and digitization&nbsp;

• Develop target operating models and future-state processes across transfer agency and investor servicing functions.​‌

&nbsp;

KEY REQUIREMENTS

&nbsp;

• 5+ years of experience within Transfer Agency, Fund Services, Investor Services, Custody, Securities Services, or Financial Services Consulting .

• Strong understanding of&nbsp; Transfer Agency operations , including investor onboarding, fund dealing, subscriptions, redemptions, shareholder servicing, distributions, and registry management.

• Proven Business Analyst experience with requirements gathering, process mapping, gap analysis, functional documentation, and stakeholder management.

• Experience delivering change and transformation initiatives across transfer agency platforms, investor servicing, or fund operations environments.

• Strong knowledge of the fund services ecosystem and interaction between&nbsp; Transfer Agency, Fund Administration, Custody, and market infrastructure providers such as Clearstream and Euroclear .

• Experience with Agile, Waterfall, or hybrid delivery methodologies.

• Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to engage business, operations, and technology teams.

• Exposure to transfer agency platforms and fund servicing systems would be advantageous.

• Immediately Available Preferred!

WHY JOIN CAPCO?

You will work on engaging projects with some of the largest banks and leading financial services in the world, on projects that will transform the financial services industry.

